{"v":4,"catch":"準備好迎接它們中最好的雜波。 終極隱藏物品遊戲！","desc":"Clutter 1000 是您將玩過的最令人興奮的 Un-Hidden Object 遊戲。\n遊戲的目標盡可能簡單。\n只需找到並匹配兩個匹配的對象即可將它們從比賽場地中移除。\n看著您的雙人跳出並合二為一，然後俯衝到跑步機上。\n您所有的舊最愛都在這裡，還有兩倍多的新寵，讓您玩上好幾天。\n\n- 數以千計的謎題\n- 彩色圖形\n- 遊戲時間\n- 定時和不定時模式\n- 雜波無限：喬的終極追求","publisher":"Ocean Media","release":"2022-03-17","genres":["益智","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.6GB / Switch 0.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b584bf2c6c25c89f01d67db1f1cfc21e77c7a608af17ac136d25b49427cd8c2a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/130224ba8233eaebc1706153466d620a4e411dee7ce346ed9d092b9e3e9f32e2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6ac039157ea6675db7d8766b4682fe8a29110f0307afb0cd5a12337081db6a73.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c78de87f24d32312271bfdc9ca25b0a63e849be16ef957643f2b76f6bcf3040e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1b45248fb6e1c965c89b5bcd3aeaf211e32f6216d2d6165170e368fac7940e16.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5d6de106f55282450a45de759da911fb0d0cdaa559a9786424f40bddaf91846c.jpg"],"titleId":"0100615017c58000","dlc":[]}